{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.007.0002",
      "source_sha256": "08dc3a20e2b74b45",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He ran away from it, and immediately the [?] fell."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.011.0000",
      "source_sha256": "ee472cfb4bfcfcbe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "One of the elders went to another elder and said to his disciple, “Prepare a little lentil gruel for us.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.011.0001",
      "source_sha256": "2e2a2ec9c30e9afe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he prepared it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.011.0002",
      "source_sha256": "e9d5686286b47b75",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said, “Soak the bread for us,” and he soaked it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.011.0003",
      "source_sha256": "dad9a2ff7cc9a59c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But they continued talking about spiritual matters all day and all night."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.012.0000",
      "source_sha256": "82a20ecb4ef03138",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "85."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.018.0000",
      "source_sha256": "8abb51ae6d1cfeb4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A brother asked Abba Serapion, “Say a word to me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.020.0001",
      "source_sha256": "c46e2115459e1029",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The elder said to him, “Go, humble your heart, and live with others, submitting to them.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.020.0010",
      "source_sha256": "e531b3a98c49e3ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“I have not found rest for a single day, and you want to rest during these eight years!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.022.0000",
      "source_sha256": "b9ffef8c63381ba1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Abba Macarius the Great went to Abba Anthony."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.024.0004",
      "source_sha256": "293a79b1771200b7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For suffering that destroys sin has been provided like a powerful medicine that works effectively in the sick person's body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.024.0005",
      "source_sha256": "5e72fde38eec38e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And this is the great ascetic discipline: endurance in illnesses and thanksgiving through hymns, sending them up to God so that we may lift our eyes to him with thanksgiving."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.024.0006",
      "source_sha256": "f328cc84936a167c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us not be as though we were waking from sleep, for we have cast away from ourselves the instruments of intemperance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.024.0007",
      "source_sha256": "c58c16934438b577",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But we see the glory of God as in a mirror through the inward eye of the heart, even if the eye of our outward body has been taken from us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.024.0008",
      "source_sha256": "458cf0b51701264f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If we become deaf, let us give thanks because we have left behind listening to [?] worthless things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.025.0002",
      "source_sha256": "13e4ea9734bfeabb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But as for our sins, let us examine ourselves on our own, so that by our own free choice we may cast away from ourselves the punishments that are to come."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.029.0008",
      "source_sha256": "ab3a3893c3891cb9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And in all these things he would give thanks to God [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.030.0006",
      "source_sha256": "d1d58dd10bc6ef58",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the elder heard these things, his heart was comforted, and he became even more vigorous."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.032.0002",
      "source_sha256": "c1af70e9149a0ea5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again, when you walk along the road and see stones and potsherds, with gold among them, can your heart regard the gold as it regards these other things?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.032.0004",
      "source_sha256": "b4b7262cac8d6f5f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The elder said to him, “Look, the passion is still alive, but it is bound.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.040.0000",
      "source_sha256": "531240702b24be97",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "An elder said, “If the inner person is watchful, then he can guard the outer person.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.041.0001",
      "source_sha256": "585c8e137e2936e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this is why we came to this place."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.041.0002",
      "source_sha256": "04b4c85462f00fd7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For someone who teaches with his mouth but does not put it into practice is in danger."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.042.0004",
      "source_sha256": "f858cbe6c2a26e7c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But if he does not give him room because of wickedness, he withdraws."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.044.0001",
      "source_sha256": "fdd0b9c4aad63b47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They saw the elders because of their great hunger resulting from their ascetic discipline."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.044.0002",
      "source_sha256": "28ed752db6901365",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "They ate with difficulty and took offense."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.046.0002",
      "source_sha256": "4101e2a8c420d153",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "But if someone comes to ask him about a saying, he runs away from him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.049.0000",
      "source_sha256": "1de87a0fdb171be8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "They also said about him that he would weave the palm leaves for two baskets into a single basket without realizing it, because his mind was occupied with contemplation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.052.0020",
      "source_sha256": "6fb074f44be0db1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Every place he goes to, he burns down."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.054.0012",
      "source_sha256": "4088c20ebf9a5ac1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "The elder said, “Give him some bread.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.057.0019",
      "source_sha256": "7f2cdf2807c849ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "But when she seized him by force, she overpowered him and dragged him inside."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.058.0006",
      "source_sha256": "882224d6506edd47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He said to himself, “I will test this man and see what kind of person he is.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.058.0007",
      "source_sha256": "d4048f0ea50bc701",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He went to his father and said, “Send my brother with me so that we can go to this place.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.063.0000",
      "source_sha256": "1624ce35a0ea23eb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He also said, “Once, while the elders were sitting and eating, he and Abba Allonius were standing and serving them.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.069.0026",
      "source_sha256": "380b67754b4f2e30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He answered, “Yes, you have harmed him a little.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.070.0002",
      "source_sha256": "d3980a0f202519d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He said, “Not measuring yourself, with understanding—this will fulfill all of Scripture.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.074.0004",
      "source_sha256": "063d5ef793ab06d6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "These are the deeds of someone who is humble in heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.076.0005",
      "source_sha256": "a5a766eda79debb1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "The elder came and knocked at the door, and he went inside to the head of the congregation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.077.0001",
      "source_sha256": "8f7ac075b004bc1b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He struck one of the elderly monks inside his cell."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.087.0000",
      "source_sha256": "17d8261b5351eeda",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "A brother asked an elder, “What does it mean to be humble in heart?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.096.0000",
      "source_sha256": "a549efcaff23dfdf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "They said about Abba Paphnutius that he was not eager to drink wine."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.102.0002",
      "source_sha256": "8fa12aa225cd6f2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "[?] a multitude of ranks of angels, beyond counting [?] so that all humanity might see these together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.111.0007",
      "source_sha256": "ee0c953787cf69e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "But the elder fled secretly and left the city so that they would not recognize him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/AP#CopScr.AP.120.0002",
      "source_sha256": "dab36cd7775c3de9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "And he also thinks to himself, “After a few days I will depart.”"
    }
  ]
}
